[Script Info]ScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080Title: Default Aegisub file[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,60,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1.5,0,1,3.8,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 50,0:01:55.48,0:01:57.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Franky, hold up!Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.39,0:02:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What–Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.70,0:02:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put on some pants before you go!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.49,0:02:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned your lesson yet?Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.35,0:02:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those briefs will cause another uproar about your public nudity!Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.94,0:02:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I'm just getting a few supplies.Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.42,0:02:14.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on. Get moving, then.Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.41,0:02:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a joke doin' all this just to celebrate an acquittal.Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.51,0:02:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, Tom-san was innocent from the get-go.Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Phew... Now, then...Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.91,0:02:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tom-san! Iceburg! Rise and shine!Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.24,0:02:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Today's the big trial!Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.22,0:02:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to face justice!Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.50,0:02:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry to the wharf!Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.04,0:02:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're handing down Tom's verdict!Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.90,0:02:52.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite the turnout for the trial.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.74,0:02:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Throngs of onlookers are coming aboard.Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.29,0:02:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you see the sea train, Your Honor?Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I rode it once.Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.94,0:03:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's marvelous. A truly amazing accomplishment.Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.28,0:03:06.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that these four islands are linked,Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.59,0:03:10.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone would object to his exoneration.Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.97,0:03:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Tom?Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.99,0:03:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't wait for it to start.Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! There won't be any seats left!Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.68,0:03:19.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna witness his acquittal with my own eyes!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.15,0:03:24.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, I can't believe it's been 14 years already.Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.11,0:03:39.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! Explosions?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.83,0:03:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get off the ship! Everyone, hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.71,0:03:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this some sort of pirate raid?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.42,0:03:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Where are these shells coming from?Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.28,0:03:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Over there!Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whose fleet is that?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.89,0:04:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never seen a battleship like that. Are they some kind of pirates?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.15,0:04:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those?! They're covered in guns!Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.80,0:04:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away from the wharf! Quickly, now! Run!Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.36,0:04:26.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Head into town at once!Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.36,0:04:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help! My son's getting trampled!Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.11,0:04:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why...Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.29,0:04:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is that?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.71,0:04:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-My...Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.47,0:04:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My ships...Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.64,0:04:50.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, there's trouble!Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.59,0:04:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky's ships are firing on the judicial ship!Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.08,0:04:57.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down. It can't be Franky. He just left for town.Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.87,0:05:01.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that! Even he wouldn't do something like this.Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.44,0:05:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This looks to be something bigger!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.53,0:05:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's stop them, Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.18,0:05:05.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.38,0:05:10.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates? Or maybe the government?Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.00,0:05:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find cover!Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stop! Move farther inland!Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get away from the docks!Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.70,0:05:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My father's still on the ship!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't allow this!Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.26,0:05:33.81,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Shit! Who would dare  to abuse my ships like this?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your Honor, hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.68,0:05:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship won't hold!Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.79,0:05:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whose ships are those?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.66,0:05:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The attack on the judicial ship was a success.Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.46,0:05:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that so? Then move on to the next stage of the plan.Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Justice requires sacrifice.Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.75,0:05:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.98,0:06:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, shall we begin you trial now,Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.67,0:06:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's Workers?Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.61,0:06:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The judicial ship is sinking.Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.01,0:06:20.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's pull back to Scrap Island.Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.43,0:06:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.75,0:06:28.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That fleet is withdrawing.Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.09,0:06:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. I've seen those ships before!Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, the ships are returning.Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.27,0:06:39.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're near the shore. We can grab 'em!Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.04,0:06:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've really done a number on us!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.47,0:06:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two men are racing here from Scrap Island.Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.91,0:06:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Tom.Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.76,0:06:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, abandon ship.Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.56,0:07:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.23,0:07:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody's on board.Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.88,0:07:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same here. They're all deserted.Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.12,0:07:09.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, what's going on?Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.56,0:07:12.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More of Franky's...Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.94,0:07:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Iceburg, watch out!Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.53,0:07:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn...Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.79,0:07:33.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My Battle Frankies got vaporized!Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg! Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.15,0:07:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.07,0:07:50.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?! What happened?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.41,0:07:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?! Say something, Ice–Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.50,0:08:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You brainless ape!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.22,0:08:13.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those secret agents who visited us the other day...Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.91,0:08:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They used your battleships on us!Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M-My ships did this to you?Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.36,0:08:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you.Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again and again...Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.36,0:08:30.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how you can leave dozens of these things lying around.Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.55,0:08:35.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're culpable for creating such weapons, Lame-ky!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.72,0:08:38.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My ships... did that to Tom-san?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.84,0:08:40.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get it now?Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.77,0:08:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The weapons we create are deadly.Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether you intend harm or not,Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,weapons don't care who they hurt.Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.90,0:08:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if it's someone you love!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.54,0:09:00.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government framed us.Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.15,0:09:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll accuse us of the judicial ship attack.Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They want the blueprints,Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.97,0:09:09.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so they're going to railroad Tom-san for the crime.Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.07,0:09:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you feign innocence in a situation like this?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.04,0:09:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If they end up taking Tom-san away,Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.55,0:09:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will...Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.70,0:09:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,never forgive you, Franky!Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.61,0:09:29.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will...Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.75,0:09:31.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.26,0:09:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.60,0:09:35.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't blame him, Iceburg!Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.97,0:09:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky did nothing wrong.Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.31,0:09:40.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you still say that at a time like this?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.47,0:09:42.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.36,0:09:46.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I made this harpoon.Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.77,0:09:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I made it so it can't be pulled free.Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.07,0:09:51.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.25,0:09:56.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No need for apologies. A little scratch like this doesn't even hurt.Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, they're over there!Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's down! How'd he get hurt so bad?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.57,0:10:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess they weren't in on the attack.Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.56,0:10:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the townspeople.Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.61,0:10:16.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, then. I suppose we ought to start heading to town ourselves.Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.10,0:10:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Spanda!Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's Spandam.Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.86,0:10:23.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These criminals...Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are responsible for the attack!Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.94,0:10:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, ladies and gentlemen.Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.88,0:10:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We at CP5 apprehended them after their assault.Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're no longer a threat.Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's charges were bound to be dropped at his trial today.Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.79,0:10:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would he do something like this?Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.36,0:10:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess he really was in league with the Pirate King.Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.67,0:10:50.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello, nice to meet you. I'm Spandam of CP5.Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.78,0:10:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were here. Thanks for your help.Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.66,0:10:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going to need to take these men into our custody.Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.94,0:10:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd like to interrogate them.Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.90,0:10:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.28,0:11:05.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Try talking your way out of this. Your credibility's shot.Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.51,0:11:09.61,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I, Spandam, will have the blueprints for the ancient weapon.Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.61,0:11:10.69,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit.Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.69,0:11:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a mess...Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.07,0:11:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, I must say, the sea train is nothing short of spectacular.Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.83,0:11:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it will contribute markedly to Water Seven's growing prosperity.Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.52,0:11:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That alone would have been enough to overturn your previous convictionDialogue: 50,0:11:30.34,0:11:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of building Gold Roger's pirate ship.Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.76,0:11:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, why pile on more crimes?Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.21,0:11:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a joke!Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.18,0:11:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We didn't attack the judicial ship!Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.39,0:11:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bastard Spandam over there did it!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.87,0:11:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is Tom's apprentice going on about?Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.09,0:12:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What would the government agency CP5 have to gain from sinking the judicial ship?Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.19,0:12:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous. That's just impossible.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You go by “Cutty Flam,” right?Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.69,0:12:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We caught you red-handed on the ambushing ships.Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.54,0:12:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moreover, your company built all those ships, right?Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.65,0:12:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ships that could cause such havoc...Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those...Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are no longer my ships!Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.08,0:12:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom broke his cuffs!Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready arms!Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.25,0:12:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the first time Tom-san's hit Franky.Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.97,0:12:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.20,0:13:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Those aren't my ships"?Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.51,0:13:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mustn't say that!Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.54,0:13:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?! I regret everything!Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.92,0:13:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I never made those ships, no one would've gotten hurt!Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.20,0:13:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Building any sort of ship...Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.81,0:13:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is not a question of right or wrong.Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.02,0:13:31.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care what kind of ships you build.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.23,0:13:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However,Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.66,0:13:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,regardless of who they hurt or how they threaten the world,Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.09,0:13:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you, as their creator, must love them.Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.49,0:13:45.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must not deny what you have created.Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.79,0:13:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never blame the ship!Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.51,0:13:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A man should be damn proud of the ships he builds!Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg... Franky...Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.25,0:14:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, don't interfere.Dialogue: 50,0:14:18.77,0:14:19.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay still!Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.00,0:14:27.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,First, the World Government framed me. And now it passes judgment on me.Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never clear my name.Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.60,0:14:32.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is how it ends.Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.05,0:14:37.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It must be tough to have your innocent ships used for such depravity.Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.30,0:14:41.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet you want to hit him, Franky.Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.54,0:14:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.58,0:14:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Tom's gone ballistic!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.16,0:14:56.54,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.76,0:14:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.02,0:14:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you keep this up...Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.00,0:15:03.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you...Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.09,0:15:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,have any idea how much you've hurt that boy?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.39,0:15:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,F-Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.81,0:15:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.81,0:15:13.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh... They shot him...Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.99,0:15:26.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Tranquilizer darts?Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.91,0:15:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suck on that, you monstrous fishman!Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.37,0:15:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, why'd you do that?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.58,0:15:41.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you morons, what are you doing?! Take them into custody already!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take these savages from Tom's Workers to Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had no idea Tom was such a violent guy.Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.87,0:15:50.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is he thinking?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.22,0:15:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew he had sold his soul to those pirates!Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.64,0:15:58.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They built those battleships just for this purpose!Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.38,0:16:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you say such a thing about Tom-san?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.69,0:16:02.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it alone!Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.78,0:16:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.88,0:16:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine.Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.11,0:16:05.74,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.59,0:16:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your Honor.Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.61,0:16:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes?Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.24,0:16:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I plead guilty to the judicial ship attack.Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.04,0:16:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.33,0:16:16.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Tom-san, take it back!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.58,0:16:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, I have just one request.Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you, you stupid fish! Who would grant a criminal a favor?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silence, CP5!Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is your request?Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.01,0:16:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If building the sea train absolves one crime,Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.97,0:16:35.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then I ask you to forgive today's offense.Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.54,0:16:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I were to grant your request, you'd be right back where you started.Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.27,0:16:46.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd still be guilty of building the Pirate King's ship, a capital offense.Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.86,0:16:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer that.Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.71,0:16:52.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I helped the man called Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.22,0:16:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm damn proud of it too!Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.41,0:17:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How outrageous!Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.28,0:17:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Imagine being proud of helping the Pirate King...Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.65,0:17:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a traitor!Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.61,0:17:06.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Fishman thug! – Bastard fish!Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.27,0:17:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, Tom-san?!Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.76,0:17:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with this. Listen to me. Don't beat yourself up.Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.50,0:17:20.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the government was this determined to get the blueprints.Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.39,0:17:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My work with Roger put me at a bit of a disadvantage.Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.99,0:17:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean you have–Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.90,0:17:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's fine.Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.83,0:17:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, even if the charges go back 14 years, everything has changed since then.Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.70,0:17:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The island is now a force to be reckoned with.Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.25,0:17:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think of the future.Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.63,0:17:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens to me,Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.89,0:17:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll still be of service to the city.Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.26,0:17:49.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My dream...Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.22,0:17:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has only just begun its journey.Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.84,0:17:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.27,0:18:00.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.59,0:18:08.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg, Franky,Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.81,0:18:11.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,take care of those blueprints.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san, Yokozuna,Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,thank you for everything.Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The tranquilizers have finally kicked in!Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.87,0:18:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arrest those three for attacking the judicial ship!Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.64,0:18:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.05,0:18:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Belay that order.Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The charges have changed.Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.65,0:18:38.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the crime of building Pirate King Gold Roger's pirate ship,Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.15,0:18:42.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,take the shipwright Tom to Enies Lobby.Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.65,0:18:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is all.Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.18,0:18:50.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn. What's gotten into that sentimental old coot?Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.07,0:18:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I have no need for his apprentices.Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.68,0:18:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Free the two apprentices!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.05,0:19:03.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san's dead in the water.Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.47,0:19:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do against the World Government.Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay strong, you two.Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.64,0:19:12.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san saved your lives!Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.85,0:19:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you go to war with them, you'll be dead before the day is out.Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.52,0:19:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby is the government's judicial island.Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.43,0:19:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one who goes thereDialogue: 50,0:19:24.64,0:19:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,has ever come back!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.32,0:19:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea train is ready for departure!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.69,0:19:32.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We're ready to go! – All right!Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro-san...Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, get him out of here now!Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.66,0:19:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.87,0:19:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ew. Move this fat, squidgy fishman!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.66,0:19:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can't stand it anymore!Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.16,0:19:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ribbit! – Ah!Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.88,0:19:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.14,0:19:52.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh!Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.47,0:19:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, no!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.08,0:20:03.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.60,0:20:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He caved in Spandam-san's face!Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.68,0:20:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's apprentice has gone berserk!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.31,0:20:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.99,0:20:11.90,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.90,0:20:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seize him! Everyone else, get Tom out of here!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.24,0:20:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just try it! I won't let you take him!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.02,0:20:21.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire at will!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.75,0:20:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let Tom-san go!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.47,0:20:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh...Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.10,0:20:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.42,0:20:33.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for it!Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! He got away!Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive that punk, Cutty Flam!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.61,0:20:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a damned criminal!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.19,0:20:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As soon as this is over, I'll have that idiot hanged!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.29,0:21:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.07,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-It's Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.19,0:21:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He intercepted us!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.09,0:21:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's on the tracks ahead with some kind of weapon.Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.68,0:21:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait right there, Yokozuna.Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.63,0:21:16.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rib-Ribbit.Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.57,0:21:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he an imbecile?Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.35,0:21:20.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your order?Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.43,0:21:22.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you an imbecile!?Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.90,0:21:26.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just keep going! We'll give him what he wants.Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.22,0:21:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's none of your concern!Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.89,0:21:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.77,0:21:34.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, Puffing Tom!Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.61,0:21:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're taking the man who created you?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.79,0:21:52.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.22,0:21:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.03,0:22:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me Tom-san back!Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.22,0:22:09.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, sea train!Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.60,0:22:18.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So your parents abandoned you? Hilarious!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.58,0:22:20.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's not that funny!Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.33,0:22:22.78,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, you're damn welcome at my house.Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.21,0:22:24.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san...Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.32,0:22:26.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,to be honest, I...Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.66,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,don't want to build ships anymore.Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.48,0:22:34.71,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't love any ship that has hurt those who are precious to me!Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.16,0:22:36.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But, Tom-san,Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.67,0:22:41.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I still want to be like you!Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.33,0:22:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Urgh!Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.66,0:22:53.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I want you to come home and keep teaching me!Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.31,0:23:04.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I, too,Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.55,0:23:07.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,want to build my dream ship!Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.60,0:23:17.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It would ply the world's uncharted seas, not giving a damn about anything!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.01,0:23:19.94,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's my dream ship!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:14.41,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-sanDialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:14.41,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-sanDialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.93,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Day of the VerdictDialogue: 2,0:01:50.17,0:01:54.93,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Day of the VerdictDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.26,0:00:31.82,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 1,0:00:32.53,0:00:36.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 2,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaraokeDialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 1,0:00:37.10,0:00:40.98,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 2,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Quality ControlDialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 1,0:00:42.48,0:00:47.11,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Pepperjack ZenefDialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 1,0:00:55.08,0:01:02.42,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking                    HaleeDialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 1,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 2,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,TimingDialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,PhosCityDialogue: 1,0:01:02.42,0:01:06.44,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,PhosCityDialogue: 0,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Subtitle EditingDialogue: 1,0:01:35.12,0:01:38.79,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Sub